00:10:51.650 --> 00:11:19.180
even well-meaning spam from friends, family, and coworkers. So we also should text messaging, where we understand the barrier to entry is higher. Like, if you're going to text me, it better be important. And if you're texting me a lot and it's not that important, I'm probably going to mute you. Or if you're in a group text and someone starts messaging too much, you exit the group text, which is why all these large group texts die out over time because the good people mute them and leave. Slack and group messaging platforms have a similar dynamic, where over time,

